                        About Genstar Paint Trade Center
                    </MudText>

                    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1"
                             Class="text-white"
                             Style="line-height:1.8;">

                        Genstar Paint Trade Center was founded by Mr. Sonny Cariño Chong in 1998.
                        He first established the business along Magsaysay Avenue, General Santos City
                        (beside Mitchy's Car Accessories).

                        <br /><br />

                        At its early stage, the company focused on automotive paints with a 75:25 ratio
                        of Car Paints to House Paints. It became the first dealer of Dupont Paints
                        (now Cromax) in the SOCKSARGEN area.

                        <br /><br />

                        Over the years, the business expanded into house, marine, and industrial paints,
                        shifting to a 60:40 product ratio while maintaining its manual mixing tradition.

                        <br /><br />

                        In <strong>2018</strong>, the company established its first branch in
                        <strong>Polomolok, South Cotabato</strong> under the name
                        <strong>KULAY PAINT SUPPLY</strong>. Since then, the branch has proudly served
                        customers from Polomolok and neighboring municipalities, providing quality paint
                        products and reliable service for their residential, commercial, and industrial
                        painting needs.

                        <br /><br />

                        Equipped with decades of experience, extensive knowledge, and expertise in paint
                        trading and custom paint mixing, Genstar Paint Trade Center continues to strive
                        to deliver affordable, high-quality paint products and exceptional customer
                        service to every client.

                    </MudText>

